Author: cracki <cracki@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 15:00:11 2026 +0330

    fix(qa4-N1): detail-shaped scan errors + standard DRF exception handler
    
    brand/views.py raised ValidationError(str(exc)) for scan failures so DRF
    returned a bare JSON array body the frontend could not parse (generic
    'Website scan failed' message). All 6 bare-string raises in scan/analyze
    flows now raise ValidationError({'detail': ...}) (brand/views.py:184,321,
    354,635,653). New core/exception_handler.py:qa_exception_handler
    (wired via settings in the SEC commit) normalizes bare str/list bodies to
    {'detail': ...} while preserving field-error dicts. Tests in
    brand/tests_qa4_status_errors.py (12) also cover QA4-new1 serializer.

